            <h2>Innovation and Significance</h2>
            <p>Current approaches to disability support often fragment services across medical, social, and technological sectors. The <span class="keyword">Atlantis</span> model represents a paradigm shift toward "seamless accessibility," where environmental modifications, assistive devices, and community support operate as a unified system.</p>

