                <strong>The <span class="keyword">Constable</span> Protocol:</strong> Named after our lead investigator, this novel research methodology centers lived experience by employing community-based participatory research (CBPR) principles, ensuring that people with disabilities lead the design process rather than serving as passive subjects.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Methodology</h2>
            <p><strong>Phase 1 (Months 1-12):</strong> Co-design workshops with 200 participants across disability types to establish the <span class="keyword">Atlantis</span> design specifications.</p>

