            <p><strong>Phase 3 (Months 31-42):</strong> Longitudinal outcome assessment using mixed methods, including the WHO Quality of Life-BREF (WHOQOL-BREF) disability module, in-depth interviews, and ecological momentary assessment (EMA).</p>
